        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:32px 40px;background:#ffffff;font-family:system-ui'><div style='font:800 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#7c3aed'>WHEEL TEST PAGE</div><h1 style='margin:14px 0 8px;font:850 40px/1.05 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Scroll me</h1><p style='margin:0 0 18px;font:400 18px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'>Zoom out until this graph is drawn as a workspace, then use the wheel over this page.</p><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 1</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 1 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 2</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 2 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 3</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 3 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 4</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 4 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 5</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 5 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 6</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 6 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 7</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 7 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 8</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 8 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 9</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 9 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 10</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 10 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'><h2 style='margin:0 0 6px;font:800 22px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Section 11</h2><p style='margin:0;font:400 15px/1.6 system-ui;color:#475569'>Scroll position marker 11 of 14. This page is deliberately taller than any frame it is shown in.</p></section><section style='padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0'>